00:16:59.410 --> 00:16:59.930
When the letter

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:05.170
A letter from Charles Davenport arrived in 1909 at New Jersey's Vineland Training School

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:06.390
for the Feeble-Minded.

