Not only was Goddard interested in the new science of heredity,

00:18:05.420 --> 00:18:09.860
he asked Davenport to guide him in making his own study of feeble-mindedness.

00:18:12.120 --> 00:18:17.830
Like lots of people who are working in institutions, doctors or social workers,

