00:45:22.100 --> 00:45:28.350
All told, the Race Betterment Conference drew an estimated 10,000 people and generated more

00:45:28.350 --> 00:45:29.810
than a million lines of press.

00:45:31.950 --> 00:45:37.380
Your efforts on behalf of eugenics are certainly beginning to bear fruit, Kellogg told Charles

00:45:37.380 --> 00:45:46.880
Davenport. The public is beginning to understand better and appreciate more. Panama Pacific Expo

00:45:46.880 --> 00:45:52.980
was really a defining moment for the American eugenics movement. The eugenics movement was

00:45:52.980 --> 00:45:59.710
coalescing. It was solidifying. These elites are all saying yes.

00:46:00.000 --> 00:46:02.440
you know, we believe in progress, and this is progress.

00:46:03.430 --> 00:46:06.290
Eugenics gave them a way to view the world and to say,

00:46:06.630 --> 00:46:10.570
okay, you know, all these vague anxieties I have

00:46:10.570 --> 00:46:12.430
about the present and particularly the future,

00:46:12.820 --> 00:46:14.300
this is what the problem is.

00:46:14.360 --> 00:46:16.380
Well, let's get to work on solving that.

00:46:23.340 --> 00:46:27.960
In May 1917, as new converts spread the eugenic creed

00:46:27.960 --> 00:46:29.780
