00:46:35.930 --> 00:46:42.570
to meet with Henry Goddard, by now considered the nation's leading expert on mental deficiency.

00:46:45.390 --> 00:46:51.240
His groundbreaking 1912 study, the Kalakak family, had awakened the public to the menace

00:46:51.240 --> 00:46:58.410
