00:47:06.090 --> 00:47:09.340
Among them, one of Goddard's own patients at Vineland,

00:47:10.130 --> 00:47:12.810
a girl he diagnosed as a moron.

00:47:14.570 --> 00:47:19.400
The Kalikak family was a huge bestseller for many, many years.

00:47:20.000 --> 00:47:23.800
References to the Kalikaks were in the speeches of politicians,

00:47:24.470 --> 00:47:28.430
books, scholarly journals, popular magazines.

00:47:28.990 --> 00:47:29.970
Everyone knew what the Kalikaks was.

00:47:30.000 --> 00:47:35.480
Kalakaks meant. You have to watch out who you mate with, or your descendants could turn out

