00:48:25.320 --> 00:48:27.900
the mental defectives lurking among them.

00:48:30.510 --> 00:48:39.410
They began in late September 1917, at Camp Lee and Camp Taylor, Camp Devins and Camp Dix.

00:48:41.460 --> 00:48:45.430
First, new recruits were sorted according to their level of literacy,

00:48:46.300 --> 00:48:49.220
and then administered one of two tests.

00:48:50.590 --> 00:48:55.680
They had one test called the Alpha Test for draftees who were literate in English,

00:48:56.200 --> 00:48:59.960
and another called the Beta Test for draftees who were not literate in English.

00:49:00.000 --> 00:49:01.580
English or illiterate completely.

00:49:03.600 --> 00:49:06.040
One of the questions on the alpha test was,

00:49:06.980 --> 00:49:10.520
the night engine is used in the Ford,

00:49:10.800 --> 00:49:12.620
the Pierce Arrow, or the Lozier car.

00:49:13.200 --> 00:49:16.980
Now, tell me, is that known to you?

00:49:18.840 --> 00:49:20.700
While the literate testers puzzled

00:49:20.700 --> 00:49:22.160
over multiple choice questions,

00:49:23.340 --> 00:49:25.800
the others attempted to draw their way out of mazes

00:49:25.800 --> 00:49:28.820
and sketch in the missing bits of simple pictures.

00:49:31.200 --> 00:49:38.660
One Sicilian recruit, Catholic, considered an image of a house and drew a crucifix where a chimney might be.

00:49:39.930 --> 00:49:40.810
He was marked wrong.

00:49:44.510 --> 00:49:50.510
It was touching to see the intense effort put into answering the questions, an army examiner later recalled,

00:49:51.680 --> 00:49:55.160
often by men who never before had held a pencil in their hands.

00:49:57.020 --> 00:49:59.970
The tests were by no means measured.

00:50:00.000 --> 00:50:01.840
of intelligence, whatever that may mean.

00:50:02.730 --> 00:50:06.190
How well you did on them depended upon your degree of education,

00:50:06.520 --> 00:50:07.900
how many years you've been in school,

00:50:08.650 --> 00:50:13.620
and also how attuned you were with middle-class culture.

00:50:15.830 --> 00:50:18.390
Administered to 1.7 million Army personnel

00:50:18.390 --> 00:50:19.950
over the course of the conflict,

00:50:20.750 --> 00:50:24.490
officers and enlisted men, black soldiers as well as white,

00:50:25.660 --> 00:50:27.680
the test led to a shocking conclusion.

00:50:28.820 --> 00:50:29.980
Roughly half of the...

00:50:30.000 --> 00:50:32.750
The draftees were considered to be morons.

00:50:36.280 --> 00:50:38.840
The Army's experience became a headline.

00:50:39.740 --> 00:50:41.320
America is degenerating.

00:50:42.360 --> 00:50:45.970
We have to somehow interrupt this swamp of defect.

00:50:50.220 --> 00:50:53.780
There was a movement to institutionalize more people at this time,

00:50:54.550 --> 00:50:55.690
driven by eugenics.

00:50:56.390 --> 00:50:59.860
You can see how an IQ test can really grease the wheels.

00:51:00.000 --> 00:51:02.500
if you're going to start moving people into institutions,

00:51:02.740 --> 00:51:04.020
if you're going to start sterilizing them, all that,

00:51:04.220 --> 00:51:06.660
you need some numbers, and the IQ test provided that.

00:51:08.510 --> 00:51:12.780
By 1919, intelligence testing was a full-fledged craze.

00:51:13.820 --> 00:51:17.740
An adapted version of the Army test, the National Intelligence Test,

00:51:18.290 --> 00:51:20.530
sold half a million copies in one year.

00:51:22.260 --> 00:51:25.220
Businesses administered mental tests to prospective employees.

00:51:26.210 --> 00:51:28.770
Schools and universities evaluated their students.

00:51:30.000 --> 00:51:33.240
and evermore paupers, prostitutes, drunkards, and delinquents

00:51:34.030 --> 00:51:36.920
found themselves suddenly with pencil in hand.

00:51:40.410 --> 00:51:43.210
Feeble-mindedness was a big fear in that era.

00:51:43.810 --> 00:51:46.290
There was a thought that there were a lot of these people out there

00:51:46.290 --> 00:51:48.890
who were deficient, who were morons,

00:51:49.540 --> 00:51:51.480
and they were not only out there,

00:51:51.770 --> 00:51:54.410
