00:52:24.140 --> 00:52:26.550
were classified as morons.

00:52:36.460 --> 00:52:39.680
To some extent, humanity's always been about othering

00:52:39.680 --> 00:52:42.570
and about, you know, there's us and there's the other.

00:52:43.810 --> 00:52:46.950
The eugenics movement really gave this scientific,

00:52:46.950 --> 00:52:50.310
you know, punch to this idea that there are us

00:52:50.310 --> 00:52:53.010
and there are the others and we're the right people.

00:52:53.450 --> 00:52:56.210
We're the people that it's important not only to favor now,

00:52:56.870 --> 00:52:58.970
but we're the people who have to own the future.

00:53:00.190 --> 00:53:04.640
Suddenly, eugenics comes along and gives them a scientific basis for believing that.

00:53:06.920 --> 00:53:14.200
Eugenics is easy to accept because it preserves existing hierarchies.

00:53:14.950 --> 00:53:16.970
It doesn't seek to overturn them.

00:53:17.390 --> 00:53:22.260
What it did was lend new weight to established hierarchies.

00:53:24.400 --> 00:53:28.870
I don't think there has ever been a time when people didn't think.

