that some people were simply better than others.

00:53:32.800 --> 00:53:35.450
The eugenics movement, like a chameleon,

00:53:35.960 --> 00:53:37.900
took on the colors of those attitudes

00:53:37.900 --> 00:53:41.490
which existed before the word eugenics was coined

00:53:41.490 --> 00:53:43.940
and certainly exists today.

00:53:54.540 --> 00:53:57.680
They'd been swarming the ports of entry since 1890.

00:53:58.880 --> 00:53:59.880
As many as a million.

00:54:00.000 --> 00:54:07.260
of them a year, in flight from poverty and oppression, lured by the promise of equality

