from the British Isles, from Germany,

00:55:28.290 --> 00:55:29.880
and then, all of a sudden,

00:55:30.000 --> 00:55:34.880
In the 1890s, immigrants started coming here from Eastern Europe, from Southern Europe.

00:55:35.300 --> 00:55:38.380
These are Catholics. These are Jews. These are peasants.

00:55:39.360 --> 00:55:44.850
And Davenport feels correctly that his race is losing the demographic game.

00:55:46.460 --> 00:55:50.240
On the receiving end of Davenport's letter was Madison Grant,

00:55:51.030 --> 00:55:56.280
